 "CET4-202506-1-Q39": {"anchor":"Recently, a leading design federation in the UK warned that the UK could face a creative skills shortage, after the latest figures revealed a drop of almost 10 percent in students studying Design and Technology.","logic":""},
 "CET4-202506-1-Q40": {"anchor":"We find that if pupils take part in Design Ventura in Year Nine it can be the trigger which leads them to opt for it at General Certificate of Secondary Education, so we are helping to keep alive something which is crucial to industry and entrepreneurship.\"","logic":""},
 "CET4-202506-1-Q41": {"anchor":"\"Teachers like it because the skills are all transferable and it helps to validate the value of design as a subject,\" she explains, telling me that nearly 600 schools have taken part so far.","logic":""},
